   "sourceHash": "5d13f2c249db4f1bbe2a4b773412428ccb932cc83aa59107aa9286199c96b53a",
   "text": "Sobre a [[OPEN_1]]Terapia de Paralisia Facial e Reabilitação Nervosa[[CLOSE_1]]",
